{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RocketShip Go Up: Demo Edition</strong> is a physics\u2011based rocket piloting challenge where precision, timing, and control define every maneuver. Learn the ropes in an interactive tutorial, then put your new skills to the test across <strong>five full\u2011fledged levels</strong>\u2014delivering the same exhilarating feel of the full release, but in a streamlined, bite\u2011sized run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire thrusters to weave through twisting caverns, drop off vital cargo, and dodge hazards like searing beams, ruthless turrets, and showers of debris. Along the way, unlock <strong>10 unique achievements</strong> that reward mastery, daring maneuvers, and flawless execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select Easy, Normal, or Hardcore difficulty to match your skill\u2014perfect for fresh pilots finding their wings or seasoned flyers chasing supremacy. Master the nuances of flight physics as you race against the clock, all while aiming for a spot on the <strong>demo leaderboards</strong>. In this short yet intense mission, every second and every move counts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943950?t=1756598677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943950?t=1756598677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943950/45f34990b023beaa84bfa8e295a42477f4f5f4c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756598677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943950/45f34990b023beaa84bfa8e295a42477f4f5f4c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756598677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detaile